id: pm-gh1613
title: "GH-1613: preserve typed PmClient validation and lookup refusals"
description: "GitHub report https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1613 on published2026.10.27 shows PmClient update validation and get not-found refusals throwing PmCliError with undefined code and empty context, while the equivalent CLI envelope has a stable code. Provide SDK-owned classification and structured field/value/allowed or item-ID facts, using SDK option names and retaining existing claim and document-parse contracts. Independently reproduced on pinned original source. Current source supplies typed producer codes and structured status/priority/lookup context; focused and full exact-coverage tests pass. Hosted admission and revised-head review remain required."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[3]: error-model,github,sdk
created_at: "2026-10-27T12:22:43.116Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-27T19:49:59.876Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-27T19:49:59.028Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-27T19:49:59.028Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 150
acceptance_criteria: "Reproduce the three published validation/lookup cases in isolated owned trackers; preserve custom-schema allowed values and existing typed claim/document-parse behavior; expose stable codes plus structured field/value/allowed or ID facts without prose inference or sensitive-value leaks; add meaningful CLI-to-SDK conformance and packed Node/Bun consumer controls, failing before and passing after the repair."
value: Let package authors and self-improving agents handle public SDK refusals without parsing English messages
impact: Public PmClient validation/lookup consumers and CLI/MCP refusal parity
parent: pm-9rgaal
risk: medium
confidence: medium
resolution: "Known status and priority validation plus missing-item lookup classify at the SDK producer with the existing public codes and structured field/value/allowed or ID context, including custom status domains."
expected_result: Equivalent SDK and CLI refusals expose actionable typed facts without mutating the tracker.
actual_result: Pinned original fails the named SDK assertion; focused linked parity test and full11512-test exact100% coverage pass. All required hosted checks and exact analyzer provenance pass on1c534fce727cf29d22cc44c20db570d41a357712. npm/Bun packed consumers pass typed errors and custom statuses.
