comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-27T12:22:43.116Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: strict complete3140-item all-status corpus with no omissions/unreadables, request-specific typed-refusal/PmClient searches and refreshed context/open/in_progress lists. Full live SDK outcome milestone, completed SDK-first architecture and document-parse classification lineage, and distinct runtime-operand sibling data/history inspected. The existing parser fix owns document decoding; runtime operand checking owns raw TypeErrors; lean refusal formatting owns renderer/claim metadata. No existing bounded owner matches already-detected PmClient validation/lookup classification, so this intake is open and unclaimed under the SDK outcome milestone. No source change or reproduced production-cause claim."
  "2026-10-27T16:00:19.719Z","harness:codex","Reproduced on the current checkout with an isolated public PmClient and CLI conformance fixture: invalid status throws an expected error with undefined code. Initial fixture setup used a scalar role where the SDK requires an array; corrected setup is independently valid, and the retained pre-fix result is the intended code AssertionError. Producer changes now attach canonical validation codes plus field/value/allowed facts, preserve custom status domains, and attach item_not_found plus ID to missing-item errors. The actual CLI code is item_not_found, so that existing code is retained rather than the report prose spelling not_found. Focused verification is running; only this item is claimed."
  "2026-10-27T16:47:16.331Z","harness:codex","The intentional contract snapshot update adds producer locations and update/update-many to the existing invalid_argument_value contract, plus the item-store source to item_not_found. It introduces no new error code or exit contract. The seven-file qualified cohort passes79 tests with one platform skip, and the final new-boundary cohort passes all3 cases. Full initial source run retained9 failures:8 old scope/wording assertions and1 host npm module-resolution setup failure. Updated compatibility expectations preserve relative caller scope in its invocation cwd, keep absolute cross-cwd replay and unchanged authoritative-byte assertions, and isolate grammar fixtures outside the real tracker. Broader final gates are running sequentially under Node24 with command-local npm resolution."
  "2026-10-27T17:21:48.727Z","harness:codex","The canonical staged runtime artifact installs through npm and Bun, and each out-of-tree public SDK consumer passes all three typed status/priority/missing-ID refusals, active custom-status allowed values and portable command scope. The artifact runtime excludes development-only qs. Public surface and generated error catalog/contract fixtures are current; typecheck and ESLint pass. Full static semantic checks pass until the preserved local transport-floor failure, which also occurs on independently built immutable baseline b76d697ee and remains subject to exact-head hosted acceptance. Graph9/9, record integrity1/1 and bounded mutation352 cases pass:345killed,7classified equivalent,0failures. The complete Node24 functional/exact-coverage run is active; its result is not yet claimed."
  "2026-10-27T17:44:21.443Z","harness:codex","Validation: qualified Node24 canonical coverage completed in 1157.23 seconds: 878 files passed plus one platform skip; 11512 tests passed and 3 platform skips; statements71117/71117, branches54752/54752, functions14628/14628, lines67266/67266, exact100% with zero uncovered. Fresh linked test receipts passed for each active owner. Packed out-of-tree npm and Bun consumers pass typed refusals, custom statuses and portable scope. Typecheck, ESLint, generated contracts/surface, 10 SDK import costs, 567-package advisory gate, runtime closure42, graph9/9, record integrity1/1, bounded mutation345 killed+7 equivalent/352 all pass. Local static transport timing remains failed (create400ms vs398ms); immutable original independently fails get419vs362/create440vs398. No threshold waived: exact-head hosted static/coverage, analyzer provenance and fresh bot review remain required before merge."
  "2026-10-27T18:15:58.483Z","harness:codex","Delivery review evidence: CodeRabbit completed the c72930a7f full review and found PM metadata corrections only. Both are addressed in1c534fce7 through pm; complete tracker context47/47passes and the actionable inline thread is resolved with one reply. Fresh reviews were requested after that push. Sourcery's exact-head check is skipped because its free250000-diff-character/7day budget is exhausted (provider reports4h8m to retry), and Greptile reports an expired trial. Neither is approval; no paid features, extra top-level acknowledgements or branch-policy changes are used. Required hosted static/coverage/platform checks remain pending."
